  "term": "MSH2",
  "definition": "MSH2 is a DNA mismatch repair gene discussed here in relation to Lynch syndrome. In this study, disease-related inherited variants in MSH2 were found in some people and families with colorectal and other Lynch syndrome-associated cancers, including one pathogenic variant shared across a large related group.",
